tBClTwo = { R2. | R2. | R2. | R2. | R2. | R2. | R2. | R2. | fis'2.\p\< | fis'2 e'4~ | e'2. | dis'2. \breathe | e'2.~\f | e'2. | << d'2. { s2 s4\< } >> | bis2.-\tweak stencil ##f \ff\> | cis'2.\p | e'2. | dis'2.~\> | dis'2.~ | dis'2.~\pp | dis'2.~ | dis'2.~\< | dis'2.\p | }  % c388: E4 tied 197-198 (same chord; not re-tongued under Cl 1's T; Adler PDF 321)  % c390: D sharp 4 held on 203-208 (was Hn 3's at 205-208), pp < p into 209 like the horns it replaces
