% c386: 192 the étouffez after the F-sharp chord is printed at the end of 192 (it sat on the rest bar 193, a system on which the harp staff is now hidden since c364 silenced the harp at 209-224, so the full score had lost it; Adler PDF 112-113, 117; Rimsky-Korsakov PDF 46).
